1
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,340
This is how I'll become.

2
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,820
This is how I'll become.

3
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,920
Supreme Commander!

4
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,770
A hero!

5
00:00:21,853 --> 00:00:23,637
This is my story!

6
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:02,517
I've seen a dream.

7
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:06,377
It's not even a dream.

8
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:08,317
It's not a dream.

9
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:11,640
I'd like to see it.

10
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:15,197
When I was in the moment.

11
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:18,297
You were me and connected.

12
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:21,357
And I'm ready to go.

13
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:22,820
I'm ready to go.

14
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:27,520
And we'll be all this way. And
we'll be all this way for you.

15
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:32,740
I will be all this world in the sky.

16
00:01:33,940 --> 00:01:35,720
We will never be anything.

17
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,037
I'll be all this time.

18
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:38,950
I'll be all

19
00:01:39,033 --> 00:01:45,760
this

20
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:48,450
way.

21
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:06,980
So that's what she meant
by physically demanding?

22
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,280
No fair.

23
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:15,857
Things are really starting to heat up!

24
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:21,120
Coming up next in round two, we have Shushu
Tsuruka of the 7th Squadron! Hell yeah!

25
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:23,920
Versus Sahara Wakata of the 6th!

26
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:28,400
Both competitors specialize
in hand-to-hand combat!

27
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:31,077
I have a feeling this is
gonna be an entire battle!

28
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:33,689
Watch this, Yuki, I'm
about to clobber her!

29
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:34,870
Okay!

30
00:02:34,953 --> 00:02:37,956
And then maybe you'll show
me some appreciation after?

31
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,070
Uh...

32
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,150
Huh?

33
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:46,950
Hmm.

34
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:51,840
Yeah, Shiho, since you lost your
match, you get to be our cheerleader.

35
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:54,342
Good luck, Sahara, you got this.

36
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:57,460
You can count on me, I'll make you proud.

37
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:05,617
Since we both like close combat, why don't
we hold off on our abilities until later?

38
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:06,530
Okay.

39
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:10,160
Ready, set, let the battle begin!

40
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,920
Here I come!

41
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:18,220
Sahara sets up with a gracious kick, But
Shushu grabs her by the leg and slams her!

42
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:20,700
She follows it up with an elbow drop!

43
00:03:24,580 --> 00:03:26,720
Sahara grabs Shushu from behind

44
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:29,640
and hits her with a German Suplex!

45
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,700
It's not over yet!

46
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:35,940
I'm so tired.

47
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:38,140
That was long enough.

48
00:03:38,860 --> 00:03:41,240
Bring out the ability! Already?

49
00:03:41,620 --> 00:03:43,577
It was just starting to get good!

50
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,189
Fine, you're gonna get it!

51
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:47,097
What number do you think she'll do?

52
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:48,540
Just one or maybe two?

53
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,249
I would guess three or so.

54
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:53,957
Both of their abilities center
around physical strength.

55
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:55,540
This'll be a short match.

56
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:57,660
Paradigm Shift!

57
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,540
Ha! Yeah!

58
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,660
Oh, my!

59
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,160
That's so neat!

60
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,200
Okay, it's my turn!

61
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:08,260
Crazy shape!

62
00:04:10,740 --> 00:04:11,570
On three!

63
00:04:11,653 --> 00:04:13,680
One, two!

64
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:16,470
Huh?

65
00:04:18,340 --> 00:04:19,940
Paper beats!

66
00:04:20,620 --> 00:04:26,840
I win rock, paper, scissors!

67
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:28,540
You totally cheated.

68
00:04:28,940 --> 00:04:31,822
Sahara unleashed her
awesome crazy shape ability!

69
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:34,577
It allows her to boost
her strength for the

70
00:04:34,660 --> 00:04:37,260
precise amount of time
she sets in advance!

71
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:40,597
One minute minimum, 60 maximum!

72
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:43,920
The shorter the time allotted,
the stronger she gets!

73
00:04:44,540 --> 00:04:48,580
However, her ability has a mandatory
three-minute Golden period!

74
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:50,100
Nice move!

75
00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:51,460
Keep it up, Sahara!

76
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:53,140
Why, you?

77
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:05,500
You're silent and impressive,
but it makes you easy to die!

78
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,310
Huh?

79
00:05:07,393 --> 00:05:08,740
And it makes you an easy target!

80
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:11,790
Ah!

81
00:05:20,740 --> 00:05:21,570
Shuzu?

82
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:28,400
Yuki, you don't have to give me that look.

83
00:05:28,740 --> 00:05:30,940
Well, are you ready to give up now?

84
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,340
Me give up?

85
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,833
You've gotta be joking.

86
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:36,377
I've only begun to show you what I can do!

87
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:38,440
Oh, wow, you've really got guts!

88
00:05:38,660 --> 00:05:39,897
It's weird to me, too.

89
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:42,120
Why am I so determined?

90
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,160
Come on, Shushu.

91
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,889
Having a boyfriend is fun.

92
00:05:46,620 --> 00:05:48,697
Jeez, you sound like a broken record.

93
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:51,417
I just don't get why
you're so opposed to it.

94
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:53,780
There's never a dull moment with him.

95
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:58,757
And seeing that look of joy on his face,
it's the best feeling in the world.

96
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:01,997
Whoa, it's rare to find a girl
so devoted to her man nowadays.

97
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,740
You're so old-fashioned.

98
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:07,557
You do you, but I'm not interested
in romance with some guy.

99
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:10,220
I'm looking for something more exciting.

100
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:16,520
I've been thinking about
joining these guys lately.

101
00:06:16,780 --> 00:06:19,427
If I went to Mato, I
bet I'd never get bored.

102
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:22,073
Every single day would be a total blast.

103
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:24,200
Very on brand. Isn't it?

104
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:27,957
I guess you just don't understand
what I'm going through.

105
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:30,158
But you'll get it one of these days.

106
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:34,140
Yuki, keep your eyes on me.

107
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,177
Cause I'm about to win!

108
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:40,731
Don't you think you'd have an easier
time moving around if you were smaller?

109
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:45,452
It's important to assess the situation
and tailor your ability accordingly!

110
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,300
You think smaller is better?

111
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:50,029
That kind of self-control
is a snooze fest!

112
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,860
I live by one motto!

113
00:06:53,060 --> 00:06:55,460
Go big or go home! Get ready!

114
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:57,460
Let's paradigm shift!

115
00:06:57,880 --> 00:07:00,900
I'll push the envelope and crush you!

116
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:08,900
I didn't see that coming! And... Going!

117
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:30,440
I was too big for you to dodge, wasn't I?

118
00:07:33,500 --> 00:07:34,480
Take this!

119
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:52,400
Hey, Ref, can you see
if she's unconscious?

120
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:53,900
Uh-huh, sure!

121
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,100
She did it!

122
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:58,020
Miss Shushu won her match! Yeah!

123
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:00,950
One!

124
00:08:01,620 --> 00:08:02,450
Two!

125
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,630
Huh?

126
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:13,240
She got back up?

127
00:08:15,060 --> 00:08:16,942
That's part of Sahara's ability!

128
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:20,177
If she loses consciousness
while her skill is active,

129
00:08:20,260 --> 00:08:22,337
her heightened killer
instinct takes control.

130
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,880
and will continue to fight on its own!

131
00:08:29,020 --> 00:08:31,314
She'll attack enemies and allies alike,

132
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:34,406
but it only makes her
that much more powerful.

133
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:39,240
Tahara can sleep anytime, anywhere.

134
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,816
That happens to be her secret weapon.

135
00:08:44,780 --> 00:08:45,610
One!

136
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,030
Two!

137
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:49,090
Three!

138
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:51,080
It's all over, folks!

139
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:52,617
The winner is...

140
00:08:52,700 --> 00:08:54,120
Tahara Wakasa!

141
00:08:57,580 --> 00:09:00,462
All because of my incredible
cheerleading skills!

142
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:02,972
She took her down in three minutes, Vlad.

143
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:06,750
Shushu!

144
00:09:06,833 --> 00:09:07,796
How are you feeling?

145
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:09,411
There's no need to worry.

146
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,640
I got her all patched up.

147
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:16,910
Oh, no!

148
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,139
Your shirt ripped!

149
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,550
Huh?

150
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:21,677
Sahara, get the hell off me, dammit!

151
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,590
I must've...

152
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:26,800
Here, take this! Shushu! Huh? Our nom!

153
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:28,710
Commander...

154
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:32,360
I'm so sorry for losing my match.

155
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,000
You almost had her.

156
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,717
We will discuss where
you can improve later.

157
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:39,620
I think you better go get changed. Sure.

158
00:09:45,860 --> 00:09:50,380
I was like an idiot, and
Yuki saw the whole thing!

159
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:07,630
Shushu?

160
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:14,640
Um, do you want anything to drink?

161
00:10:15,020 --> 00:10:17,608
I can grab it for you
while you get dressed.

162
00:10:18,660 --> 00:10:20,120
No, I'm okay.

163
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:23,400
If there's anything I
can do, just let me know.

164
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,840
I am the caretaker.

165
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:33,180
Can you take care of my memories and
erase that pitiful excuse for a match?

166
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:42,840
I think it sucks you didn't win, but
I don't think it was pitiful at all.

167
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:46,940
You mean it?

168
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:52,682
To be perfectly honest, I wanted to see
more of the wrestling you did at the start.

169
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:56,228
You would've, if she
hadn't been a buzzkill.

170
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,320
Hey, Yuki?

171
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:04,990
Uh...

172
00:11:05,073 --> 00:11:06,820
Can you close your eyes for a sec?

173
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:08,630
Uh...

174
00:11:08,713 --> 00:11:09,543
Uh, sure.

175
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:23,330
Mm-hmm.

176
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,240
Hey, Shushu!

177
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:33,480
To be fair, I did tell
you to close your eyes.

178
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:35,994
Okay, but why the hell did you kiss me?

179
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,120
Well, I...

180
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:40,540
Uh... Hmm.

181
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:43,750
Uh...

182
00:11:43,833 --> 00:11:47,037
I figured I would chase the shock
of losing with an even bigger shock!

183
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,414
That's the power move!

184
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:52,210
Uh...

185
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:57,400
I can't tell him how I feel
until I get him to like me more.

186
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:03,960
Any anomalies in Mato? Nay?

187
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:06,870
No.

188
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:12,306
There's nothing out of the...

189
00:12:17,020 --> 00:12:17,850
Huh?

190
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:24,677
A spy?

191
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:27,380
Wow, we only just broke our cover.

192
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:28,620
Not bad.

193
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:33,740
Tell the others I said hi, and
that the battle begins now.

194
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:42,780
Who was that? What's wrong?

195
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:44,314
Did you see something?

196
00:12:44,940 --> 00:12:45,770
I...

197
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:56,145
Shuki, where in the world
are they coming from?

198
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:00,440
Don't worry, you can relax.

199
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:02,840
My barrier is impenetrable.

200
00:13:03,900 --> 00:13:06,120
This flimsy thing is a barrier?

201
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,160
A humanoid?

202
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:13,200
I am Riren and this absurdity
fills me with laughter!

203
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,960
No way!

204
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:20,017
That thing cracked my barrier!

205
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:22,041
We're calling off the exhibition.

206
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,480
What a bunch of pests!

207
00:13:24,940 --> 00:13:26,881
It's about time you went extinct!

208
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,500
You're a dying breed!

209
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:32,160
All hands prepare for battle!

210
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:35,020
Tenka! I'm on it.

211
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:37,717
I'll take the non-combatants
back to the dorm.

212
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:40,094
And have Nei give you her recon report!

213
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:44,900
Destroy every last Shuki! Yes, ma 'am!

214
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,640
I'll handle this one on my own!

215
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:56,110
Commander!

216
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,110
Shushu!

217
00:13:58,500 --> 00:14:00,620
Can you fight? Yeah!

218
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,700
Paradigm Shift!

219
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,680
Taste my boot!

220
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:11,320
I'm already feeling as good as new!

221
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,500
Like this!

222
00:14:15,980 --> 00:14:17,980
Don't let up on the crowd control!

223
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:19,436
I'll cover your six!

224
00:14:25,060 --> 00:14:26,360
No, not them.

225
00:14:27,180 --> 00:14:28,010
Going somewhere?

226
00:14:28,093 --> 00:14:29,260
I'm your opponent.

227
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,620
Not you either.

228
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:37,780
But perhaps I'll burn you down to a crisp.

229
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:43,630
Oh?

230
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,649
Yachio, are you all right?

231
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:51,739
He's gonna be a tough one to crack.

232
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:06,520
Just now, you stepped in because you knew
the lightning was coming ahead of time.

233
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:08,840
You bastard!

234
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,460
You'll pay for that!

235
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:15,930
Commander!

236
00:15:16,013 --> 00:15:18,660
Let me ride on Yuki's
back with you! With her?

237
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,737
Two people at the same time?

238
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:22,840
But we've never tried that before!

239
00:15:23,140 --> 00:15:23,997
All right, get on!

240
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:24,910
Huh?

241
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,420
You can trust me.

242
00:15:31,260 --> 00:15:32,090
Let's go.

243
00:15:32,173 --> 00:15:33,940
The three of us. Right!

244
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,060
I've got a gut feeling.

245
00:15:37,700 --> 00:15:39,180
That with two masters,

246
00:15:39,900 --> 00:15:42,100
he'll take on a more powerful form.

247
00:16:11,520 --> 00:16:14,457
so what do you think yuki
ready to use new powers

248
00:16:14,540 --> 00:16:18,900
let's give them hell
power is coursing through

249
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:21,480
I bet I could do it now.

250
00:16:21,780 --> 00:16:23,460
That move she did back then.

251
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:28,428
I'll use the same Methodist
Brand Break to channel my energy!

252
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,120
Howling Blast!

253
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:37,640
So that's what two can do! Perfect!

254
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:40,117
Now we can annihilate
the Swarm in one blow!

255
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,517
But what about Yachiho?

256
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:42,580
She'll be fine.

257
00:16:42,800 --> 00:16:44,877
The Sixth Squadron is in great hands.

258
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,140
They've got Tenka.

259
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:48,381
There's still two more humanoids?

260
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:49,490
Yes, ma 'am.

261
00:16:49,620 --> 00:16:51,940
I can't see them now, but I'm sure.

262
00:16:53,060 --> 00:16:53,890
Huh.

263
00:16:53,973 --> 00:16:54,803
All right, then.

264
00:16:54,886 --> 00:16:55,752
We'll take it from here.

265
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:05,740
I won't let you outshine me.

266
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:12,837
We'll give them something
better than an exhibition match.

267
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:15,120
We'll give them a commander showdown!

268
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:18,870
Roger!

269
00:17:18,953 --> 00:17:22,397
Lady Ted and Lady Kyo are out
there fighting and I'm stuck here?

270
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:24,957
It's because the dorm has
the sturdiest barrier.

271
